<title>USA: Action Performance buys Sports Image.</title>
<headline>Action Performance buys Sports Image.</headline>
<dateline>TEMPE, Ariz. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Action Performance Cos Inc said Thursday it acquired Sports Image Inc, a Charlotte, North Carolina-based marketer of licensed motor sports apparel and souvenir items, for about $30 million.</p>
<p>The purchase price consisted of a $24 million promissory note due Jan 2, 1997 and about 400,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>Action's shares rose 1-1/4 to 16-3/8 in Nasdaq trading Thursday.</p>
